../../apps/backend

# Git
../../.git
../../.git.corrupt
../../.claude

# Misc & docs
../../misc
../../*.md
../../.mcp.json

# Root duplicates (macOS Finder copies — massive, must be excluded)
../../package-lock 2.json
../../apps 2
../../node_modules 2
../../packages 2
../../web 2
